{"id":"n28348-1-7","stage":3,"title":"다름없다 · 一样","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28348-1-7-1","ko":"선후배의 사이가 아주 좋아 보이네요.","zh":"前后辈之间的关系看起来真好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선후배의","meaning":"师兄弟，前后辈","explanation":"선후배：师兄弟，前后辈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"선후배","audio":"/audio/021740018842040bfbb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63201","senseId":"1","lemma":"선후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"021740018842040b","term":"선후배","zh":"师兄弟，前后辈","audio":"/audio/021740018842040bfbb4.mp3","entryId":"63201","definition":"师兄和师弟，或前辈和后辈。","pronunciation":["선후배"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，亲，和睦，美满","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"相互亲近、亲密。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/039b2be7f31eff2591fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28348-1-7-2","ko":"그럼요. 우리는 형제와 다름없는 사이인걸요.","zh":"那当然，我们亲如兄弟。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼요.","meaning":"当然、那是当然","explanation":"그럼요：当然、那是当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼요","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:그럼요:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼요","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형제와","meaning":"兄弟","explanation":"형제：兄弟；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"1","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다름없는","meaning":"一样，没有区别","explanation":"다름없다：一样，没有区别；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다름없다","audio":"/audio/3ab8aca15af92dcfe28e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28348","senseId":"1","lemma":"다름없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이인걸요.","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ걸요：礼貌地表示发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ef69d4f567549e5e","term":"그럼요","zh":"当然、那是当然","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3","definition":"礼貌地肯定对方的问题或说法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"哥哥和弟弟。","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"3ab8aca15af92dcf","term":"다름없다","zh":"一样，没有区别","audio":"/audio/3ab8aca15af92dcfe28e.mp3","entryId":"28348","definition":"相互相同或相似。","pronunciation":["다르멉따"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]}],"audio":"/audio/be49e81c5bedfd4afa6b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.698,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28348","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["前后辈之间的关系看起来真好。","那当然，我们亲如兄弟。","帮忙主持会议的翻译人员都找齐了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["前后辈之间的关系看起来真好。","那当然，我们亲如兄弟。","帮忙主持会议的翻译人员都找齐了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
